  "Name": "Rabbids: Alive & Kicking",
  "Overview": "Rabbids: Alive & Kicking is a Kinect activity party game - the sixth game from the Raving Rabbids franchise. The game was exclusively developed for the Kinect and consists of a number of minigames for up to 4 players, featuring Quick Play, Party Games and Raving Rabbids modes.\n\nParty Games mode includes 3 games:\n\n• Forfeit: Challenging friends in a series of minigames. When a player loses a game, he has to perform some sort of crazy behavior.\n• The Kitty: Each player plays a series of minigames to try and amass points and fill the kitty.\n• Carrot Juice: Take turns to spin the wheel and select a game. When the player loses, his avatar drinks a glass of carrot juice.",
